Open findings and observations from the proof targets.

One entry per item: where, what, how it was established, what is
undecided.  Remove an entry when the fix is committed and its target
has a mutant_prefix/.  "read" = established by reading the source
only; "cbmc" / "native" = reproduced by that engine.

Unfixed, with a failing target

ffs/mountfs (cbmc)
	ffs_mountfs() trusts superblock geometry: fs_sbsize smaller than
	struct fs; fs_fsize 0; fs_cssize reaching a panic; fs_bsize
	against fs_frag * fs_fsize overflow; fs_ncg overflow.
	Undecided: whether to draft validation (an ffs_validate), and
	whether a reachable panic() on a corrupt image is a finding.

acpi/amlprims (cbmc)
	The AML primitive readers read past the end of the scope; the
	interface carries no bound.  A fix changes the interface.

Unfixed, no target

sys/dev/acpi/acpimadt.c, acpimadt_attach (read)
	ioapic_find_bybase() result dereferenced without a NULL test.

sys/net/rtsock.c, rtm_xaddrs (read)
	A break ends the validation loop early, leaving later sockaddrs
	unchecked.  Undecided: removing it may reject messages routing
	daemons send today.

sys/dev/ipmi.c (read)
	kcs_wait() loops with no bound while the device holds IBF.
	smic_recvmsg() counts a byte in c_rxlen when the read failed.
	SMIC start/end status checks only print in debug builds.
	kcs_recvmsg() and smic_recvmsg() accept an over-long reply as a
	truncated success if the device then reports ready.

sys/netinet/tcp_input.c, SACK handling (read, from netinet/tcp_sack_option)
	A zero-length hole can be created; snd_numholes can go stale;
	rcv_lastsack relies on an invariant stated nowhere.  None
	verified beyond the reading.

sys/netinet6/ip6_input.c, ip6_process_hopopts (read)
	Returns -1 after icmp6_error() without clearing *mp, contrary to
	its comment; the one caller does not read *mp after -1.

sys/net80211/ieee80211_input.c, ieee80211_parse_rsn_body (read, from
net80211/rsn_parse)
	rsn_npmkids is a u_int8_t (ieee80211_priv.h) and receives the
	16-bit PMKID count: a count of 256 or more is truncated, and the
	group management cipher is then read from inside the PMKID list.
	Bounds hold (the target's postcondition); a parsing mismatch
	only.

sys/net/rtsock.c, rtm_setmetrics (native, from net/rtm_output_cached)
	expire = in->rmx_expire, a 64-bit value from the message, then
	expire -= gettime(): signed overflow for values near INT64_MIN,
	undefined behaviour (the amd64 kernel builds with -fno-wrapv).
	Root only, no memory effect.  Undecided: whether to bound or
	saturate rmx_expire.

sys/netinet6/nd6_nbr.c, nd6_ns_input (read, from netinet6/nd6_proxy)
	proxydl = satosdl(rt->rt_gateway) is used by nd6_na_output after
	rtfree(rt).  The table's reference keeps the gateway alive unless
	the route is deleted in between; deletion needs the exclusive net
	lock and nothing on the path sleeps, and nd6_cache_lladdr (no body
	in the target) deletes only routes that fail the proxy tests.  No
	path found; the target cannot exclude one.

sys/netinet/ip_icmp.c, icmp_reflect (read, from netinet/icmp_reflect)
	m_resethdr(m) deletes the packet's tags before ip_srcroute(m)
	looks for PACKET_TAG_SRCROUTE, so a reflected echo, timestamp,
	mask or information request never carries the reversed source
	route.  Functional only; source-routed packets are refused unless
	net.inet.ip.sourceroute is set.  Undecided: intended or not.

sys/netinet6/icmp6.c, icmp6_redirect_input (read)
	icmp6len comes from ip6_plen, 0 for a jumbogram; ip6_exthdr_get(
	&m, off, 0) then guarantees no bytes and the redirect's fields are
	read beyond that.  Needs a packet of 65536 bytes or more; not
	covered.

Gaps in the targets themselves

netinet/tcp_dooptions
	The native engine never reaches tcpstat_inc(tcps_rcvgoodsig);
	CBMC does.  Cause not diagnosed.
netinet/ip_dooptions
	Native run VACUOUS in the default time: the source-route forward
	anchor is not reached.
net/mbuf_split
	The cluster/reference path and its recursion are covered
	natively only.
net/pppoe_disc, net/sppp_lcp_rcr
	Bounded to 26 and 24 bytes; no loop contract fits (README "When
	a run exhausts time or memory").
netinet6/ip6_hopopts_input
	Packets of up to 56 bytes; 72 timed out.
common/mbufcontract.h
	The contract models are hand-written; nothing ties them
	mechanically to the net/mbuf_* proofs of the real functions.
no expect.native for most targets
	The native suite pass (suite.sh -n) has not been recorded.
